\newlabel{fig:main-c8066b8}{{5}{9}{Official \texttt {uifo\_800\_3000} benchmark, original vs.\ the shipped commit \texttt {c8066b8}, phase by phase (log scale). Complete first run 35.12\,s $\to $ 0.586\,s ($60\times $); warm 15.22\,s $\to $ 0.0795\,s ($192\times $). Sensitivity was already about 1\,ms and is unchanged. Source: \texttt {results/epyc-c8066b8/main/}}{figure.5}{}}
